    ["s0351","literal","For retrograde conjunction, with the days of separation-from-conjunction difference subtract if in excess and add if in deficiency, and with the degrees subtract if in excess and add if in deficiency from that planet's retrograde fixed-conjunction provisional accumulation; this is that planet's retrograde fixed-conjunction fixed accumulation in days and parts and seconds;","For retrograde conjunction, with the days of separation-from-conjunction difference subtract if in excess and add if in deficiency, and with the degrees of separation-from-conjunction difference add if in excess and subtract if in deficiency from that planet's retrograde fixed-conjunction provisional accumulation; this is that planet's retrograde fixed-conjunction fixed accumulation in days and parts and seconds;","距合差度盈加縮減 requires add-on-excess and subtract-on-deficiency for the degree correction; the literal had inverted those signs, and the repair restores them.","high","applied"]
